<title>AUSTRALIA: Lemvest half year net profit surges.</title>
<headline>Lemvest half year net profit surges.</headline>
<dateline>SYDNEY 1996-02-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>Half year to Dec 31</p>
<p>		 (million A$ unless stated)</p>
<p>    Operating profit		     3.64 vs 2.70</p>
<p>    Net					2.56 vs 1.78</p>
<p>    Dividend (cents)		     12.0 vs 10.0</p>
<p>    Sales				   44.84 vs 27.36</p>
